"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"A 14-year-old suspected shooter is dead, according to authorities. A female student told the BBC she had to climb over the school fence to escape.\",            \"english_title\": \"Suspected Shooter Dead\",            \"translated_version\": \"Un sospechoso de 14 a\u00f1os est\u00e1 muerto, dicen las autoridades. Una estudiante dijo a la BBC que tuvo que trepar la cerca de la escuela para escapar.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Sospechoso Muerto\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Meta has been ordered to pay a total of $942 million in fines, which includes an additional $375 million in the case.\",            \"english_title\": \"Meta Fined\",            \"translated_version\": \"Meta tiene que pagar un total de $942 millones en multas, que incluye $375 millones m\u00e1s en el caso.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Meta Multada\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"A team evacuated a patient from McMurdo Station, landing a plane in total darkness and temperatures of -43\u00b0C.\",            \"english_title\": \"Patient Evacuated\",            \"translated_version\": \"Un equipo evacu\u00f3 a un paciente de la Estaci\u00f3n McMurdo, aterrizando un avi\u00f3n en total oscuridad y temperaturas de -43\u00b0C.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Paciente Evacuado\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"At least 34,002 Ukrainian properties have been seized or identified for seizure since 2024, according to a BBC investigation.\",            \"english_title\": \"Ukrainian Properties Seized\",            \"translated_version\": \"Al menos 34,002 propiedades ucranianas han sido tomadas o identificadas para ser tomadas desde 2024, seg\u00fan una investigaci\u00f3n de la BBC.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Propiedades Ucranianas Tomadas\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Seoul's lunar orbiter took pictures of the Moon before and after a part of SpaceX's rocket hit its surface on Wednesday.\",            \"english_title\": \"Moon Pictures Taken\",            \"translated_version\": \"El orbitador lunar de Se\u00fal tom\u00f3 fotos de la Luna antes y despu\u00e9s de que una parte del cohete de SpaceX golpeara su superficie el mi\u00e9rcoles.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Fotos de la Luna\"        }    ]}"